WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,850
It also depends on your traffic volume.

2
00:00:06,090 --> 00:00:13,410
It was you who told Pei Qian the news about Boss Jin coming to Jiangcheng. I don’t understand what you are saying.

3
00:00:13,690 --> 00:00:14,690
Still pretending to me

4
00:00:15,210 --> 00:00:16,330
Dare to go against me

5
00:00:16,610 --> 00:00:17,610
Believe it or not, I let you

6
00:00:19,870 --> 00:00:24,750
Boss Xue came here early in the morning to drive Pei Qian crazy

7
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:26,820
Why do you call me grandpa?

8
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:31,950
Let me tell you by the way

9
00:00:32,610 --> 00:00:35,250
The news that Boss Jin came to Jiangcheng was not told to me by Boss Lin.

10
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:37,460
I bought your driver

11
00:00:37,820 --> 00:00:40,300
And it’s only 10,000 yuan, Boss Xue

12
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:42,100
You're not very good at being a boss.
